{"title":"Scarlet Fir Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3\u003eBring Home the Rich, Natural Beauty of the Scarlet Fir Artificial Christmas Tree\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInspired by the natural beauty of the Black Hills Spruce, the Scarlet Fir artificial Christmas tree collection from Carol's Christmas Conifers offers forest inspired character. With its rich, dark green foliage, naturally layered branch structure and full traditional silhouette, the Scarlet Fir captures the lush, organic look of a real evergreen in stunning detail. Crafted with mixed PE and PVC foliage, its branches have a lifelike texture and natural variation that makes it one of the most natural looking artificial Christmas trees.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhy choose the Scarlet Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Scarlet Fir is the ideal choice for those drawn to the deep, rich tones of a true forest evergreen. Its branch construction delivers exceptional texture and fullness, with naturally varied branch tips that replicate the dense, dark-needled character of a real spruce. The Scarlet Fir's dark green foliage creates a lush backdrop that makes ornaments, lighting, and ribbon stand out, giving it visual depth and richness that looks and feels luxurious.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIs the Scarlet Fir a realistic Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes. The Scarlet Fir is part of our \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/realistic-trees\" title=\"Realistic Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003erealistic artificial Christmas tree collection\u003c\/a\u003e. Its mixed PE and PVC foliage closely replicates the natural variation of a real fir Christmas tree, with detailed branch tips and organic branch spacing that give an authentically lifelike appearance. The result is a tree that looks less like a traditional artificial Christmas tree, and more like a stunning freshly cut evergreen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eHow do you decorate the Scarlet Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Scarlet Fir offers a perfect canvas for a wide range of holiday decorating styles. Its dark tone pairs especially well with warm gold and copper accents as well as traditional \u003ca title=\"Burgundy Essential Glass Ornaments\" href=\"/\/products\/24-pack-burgundy-essential-glass-ornament?variant=42946036695240\"\u003eburgundy red\u003c\/a\u003e and emerald green. Its full branch structure handles heavy decorating with ease. Layered garland, \u003ca title=\"Christmas Ribbons\" href=\"/\/collections\/ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e, and \u003ca title=\"Christmas Ornaments\" href=\"/\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\"\u003eornament collections\u003c\/a\u003e all look stunning against the lush dark green backdrop. For those who prefer a more understated approach, the Scarlet Fir's naturally beautiful foliage also makes it a perfect fit for minimal decoration.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIs the Scarlet Fir available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Scarlet Fir collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate your decorating preferences. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur pre-lit Scarlet Fir artificial Christmas trees feature professionally installed lighting that glows warmly throughout the rich, layered foliage creating a beautiful holiday ambiance. With Power Pole Technology, the setup is seamless - no tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect and your tree lights up!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhat is the difference between the Scarlet Fir and the Alpine Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoth the Scarlet Fir and the Alpine Fir are realistic artificial Christmas tree collections crafted with mixed PE and PVC foliage, while they look similar they have distinct looks that suit different preferences. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Scarlet Fir features a darker green tone, longer individual branches, and a more open natural branch structure. Its silhouette has a wild, organic quality that closely mimics the character of a real forest evergreen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca title=\"Alpine Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"/\/collections\/alpine-fir-trees\"\u003eAlpine Fir\u003c\/a\u003e has a brighter, medium green tone with a denser, more tightly layered branch structure, and a softer more timeless Christmas tree silhouette. It is more symmetrical than the Scarlet Fir with a refined elegant appearance that feels traditional and polished. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you love a darker, more natural looking tree then the Scarlet Fir is your match. If you prefer something similar but brighter and more classically shaped, then the Alpine Fir may be the right fit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIs the Scarlet Fir easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes. The Scarlet Fir is designed for easy setup, long-term durability, and convenient after-season storage. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly. To get the best results, plan to spend some time shaping and fluffing the individual branch tips by hand during the initial set up. Once shaped, the Scarlet Fir looks full, lush and beautifully realistic with minimal ongoing effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand and complimentary setup gloves to help you shape and fluff the branches during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep your tree protected between holiday seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore the Scarlet Fir collection and find the right size that brings forest inspired Christmas charm into your home this holiday season. \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-foot-scarlet-fir-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Scarlet Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the wonder of the season with the artfully crafted Scarlet Fir, thoughtfully designed to emulate the breathtaking beauty of the majestic Black Hills Spruce. Its realistic branches, true-to-life color, and delicate tips create an elegant, festive centerpiece that captures the charm of a real tree, without the upkeep. Make every holiday moment unforgettable with this stunning tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Unlit","offer_id":40284905406664,"sku":"SF-T6.5-U","price":289.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/scarlet-fir-artificial-christmas-tree.jpg?v=1722013540"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-scarlet-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Scarlet Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the wonder of the season with the artfully crafted Scarlet Fir, thoughtfully designed to emulate the breathtaking beauty of the majestic Black Hills Spruce. Its realistic branches, true-to-life color, and delicate tips create an elegant, festive centerpiece that captures the charm of a real tree, without the upkeep. Make every holiday moment unforgettable with this stunning tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Unlit","offer_id":40284905537736,"sku":"SF-T7.5-U","price":349.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/scarlet-fir-artificial-christmas-tree_9e1eff63-a7b9-441d-8cfa-6c38adfe0631.jpg?v=1722013572"},{"product_id":"9-foot-scarlet-fir-tree-unlit","title":"9' Scarlet Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the wonder of the season with the artfully crafted Scarlet Fir, thoughtfully designed to emulate the breathtaking beauty of the majestic Black Hills Spruce. Its realistic branches, true-to-life color, and delicate tips create an elegant, festive centerpiece that captures the charm of a real tree, without the upkeep. Make every holiday moment unforgettable with this stunning tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Unlit","offer_id":40284905767112,"sku":"SF-T9-U","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/scarlet-fir-artificial-christmas-tree_c8171daa-ff5e-47a5-bd09-09be386fc6dd.jpg?v=1722013580"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-scarlet-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Scarlet Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 800 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the wonder of the season with the artfully crafted Scarlet Fir, thoughtfully designed to emulate the breathtaking beauty of the majestic Black Hills Spruce. Its realistic branches, true-to-life color, and delicate tips create an elegant, festive centerpiece that captures the charm of a real tree, without the upkeep. Make every holiday moment unforgettable with this stunning tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ LED","offer_id":40284906127560,"sku":"SF-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Scarlet-Fir-v2_258fd985-d3b0-45c7-a94b-c67d936baf09.jpg?v=1722013587"},{"product_id":"9-foot-scarlet-fir-tree-led","title":"9' Scarlet Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 1000 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the wonder of the season with the artfully crafted Scarlet Fir, thoughtfully designed to emulate the breathtaking beauty of the majestic Black Hills Spruce. Its realistic branches, true-to-life color, and delicate tips create an elegant, festive centerpiece that captures the charm of a real tree, without the upkeep. Make every holiday moment unforgettable with this stunning tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ LED","offer_id":40284906553544,"sku":"SF-T9-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Scarlet-Fir-v2_ba06fe51-82e9-47c6-887b-9e0b877bde4f.jpg?v=1722013589"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/scarlet-fir-artificial-christmas-tree_a8c1b2dd-12f3-4a17-8819-ac845acd5959.jpg?v=1762081713","url":"/\/collections\/scarlet-fir-trees.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}